; Specs/ui_rules.t27 -- Ponte: what the window shows and allows
; Mirrors the interface parts of PonteApp/AppRules.swift one to one: run state, start banners, autosave,
; which controls are enabled, status lights and the latency colour, the source menu sections, the
; translator setting, the setup wizard, the text size and the subtitle overlay (same codes, constants
; and order of checks; each function names the Swift function it mirrors). Codes are Int32, milliseconds
; Int64. Swift keeps the views and their Russian texts. ASCII only.
; Generated C: Sources/PonteSpecs/ui_rules.h (Specs/generate.sh).

module PonteUiRules;

